### BANK API - VS Code REST Client (sustituye IDs después de cada creación)
@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@household = REEMPLAZA_CON_ID_DE_HOGAR
@digital = REEMPLAZA_ID_DE_CUENTA_DIGITAL
@physical = REEMPLAZA_ID_DE_CUENTA_FISICA
@central = REEMPLAZA_ID_DE_CENTRAL
@sams = REEMPLAZA_ID_DE_SAMS
@period = REEMPLAZA_ID_DE_QUINCENA

### 1. Crear hogar (Basic Auth del propietario (usuario: olda))
POST {{base}}/households
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Familia LGZV","displayName":"Olda"}

### 2. Mi perfil
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE

### 3. Agregar a Cecy como editora
POST {{base}}/households/{{household}}/members
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"cecy","displayName":"Cecy","role":"EDITOR"}

### 4. Cuenta digital (repite PHYSICAL para efectivo)
POST {{base}}/households/{{household}}/accounts
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Principal digital","type":"DIGITAL"}

### 5. Sobre Central / sobre Sam's (ambos físicos)
POST {{base}}/households/{{household}}/envelopes
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Central de Abastos","accountId":"{{physical}}","type":"SPENDING","category":"Alimentación"}

### 6. Plantilla quincenal (fragmento didáctico)
PUT {{base}}/households/{{household}}/budget-template
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedIncome":21000.00,"allocations":[{"envelopeId":"{{central}}","amount":4500.00},{"envelopeId":"{{sams}}","amount":1000.00}]}

### 7. Crear Q01
POST {{base}}/households/{{household}}/budget-periods
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE
Content-Type: application/json

{"startDate":"2026-11-15","endDate":"2026-11-30","open":true}

### 8. Depositar nómina
POST {{base}}/households/{{household}}/movements/incomes
Idempotency-Key: bank-example-1
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE
Content-Type: application/json

{"periodId":"{{period}}","accountId":"{{digital}}","amount":21000.00,"description":"Nómina"}

### 9. Retirar dinero digital > físico (solo dinero libre)
POST {{base}}/households/{{household}}/movements/transfers
Idempotency-Key: bank-example-2
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE
Content-Type: application/json

{"periodId":"{{period}}","fromAccountId":"{{digital}}","toAccountId":"{{physical}}","amount":5500.00,"description":"Retiro para sobres"}

### 10. Apartar efectivo en Central
POST {{base}}/households/{{household}}/movements/allocations
Idempotency-Key: bank-example-3
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE
Content-Type: application/json

{"periodId":"{{period}}","envelopeId":"{{central}}","amount":80.00,"description":"Fondeo parcial de ejemplo"}

### 11. Preview gasto con insuficiencia
POST {{base}}/households/{{household}}/movements/expenses/preview
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE
Content-Type: application/json

{"periodId":"{{period}}","targetEnvelopeId":"{{central}}","amount":150.00,"description":"Carne"}

### 12. Gasto con financiamiento desde dos sobres (Sam's debe tener antes >= 70)
POST {{base}}/households/{{household}}/movements/expenses
Idempotency-Key: bank-example-4
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE
Content-Type: application/json

{"periodId":"{{period}}","targetEnvelopeId":"{{central}}","amount":150.00,"description":"Carne","fundingSources":[{"envelopeId":"{{central}}","amount":80.00},{"envelopeId":"{{sams}}","amount":70.00}]}

### 13. Dashboard
GET {{base}}/households/{{household}}/dashboard
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE

### Consultar página con filtros opcionales
GET {{base}}/households/{{household}}/movements?page=0&size=20&periodId={{period}}&accountId={{physical}}&envelopeId={{central}}
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE

### Fondear Sam's antes del gasto inteligente si todavía no tiene fondos
POST {{base}}/households/{{household}}/movements/allocations
Idempotency-Key: bank-example-fondeo-sams
Authorization: Basic olda CAMBIA_ESTA_CLAVE
Content-Type: application/json

{"periodId":"{{period}}","envelopeId":"{{sams}}","amount":1000.00,"description":"Fondeo Sam's"}

# Cada clave representa una única operación; cambia la clave para registrar otra operación.
# Repetir clave y datos devuelve la respuesta original. La misma clave con datos diferentes responde 409.
